# The drowned city over the shoulder: its most characteristic floor at noon,
# in the golden hour, and at night; then beside a tide gauge, where the water
# still comes in; with the frame cost over five seconds standing at noon.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/lands_drowned.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0 --view=shoulder --stats
coast calm
hour 12
place typical_drowned_city
wait 3.0
shot noon with land:drowned_city
perf stats begin
wait 5.0
perf stats end drowned-noon
hour 19
wait 2.0
shot golden with land:drowned_city
hour 22.5
wait 2.0
shot night with land:drowned_city
hour 12
near tide_gauge
wait 2.5
shot gauge with land:drowned_city
